1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:08,027
It's Easter today, but I'm still in bed.
You might be wondering why. It's because

2
00:00:08,027 --> 00:00:12,347
there's nothing exciting enough to get
me up.

3
00:00:12,697 --> 00:00:17,385
At our house, holidays are always the
same. Mom has to work, so she cooks for

4
00:00:17,385 --> 00:00:20,246
us early in the morning and leaves for
her job.

5
00:00:20,596 --> 00:00:25,346
My dad, my brother and I spend the day
watching TV. It's not much different

6
00:00:25,346 --> 00:00:26,549
from any other day.

7
00:00:26,899 --> 00:00:33,163
Still in bed, I thought I heard my
mother's voice. So I ran out to see.

8
00:00:33,213 --> 00:00:35,571
Mom is in the living room, making
coffee.

9
00:00:36,213 --> 00:00:39,268
Fresh grass covers the floor, and
incense is burning.

10
00:00:39,713 --> 00:00:45,957
My brother and my dad sit holding their
coffee. You can tell they're as happy as

11
00:00:45,957 --> 00:00:46,347
I am.

12
00:00:46,697 --> 00:00:48,320
I looked at them, and I was so happy.

13
00:00:50,197 --> 00:00:56,083
This is my first holiday memory with my
mother. To this day, it's the best day

14
00:00:56,083 --> 00:00:56,913
of my life.

15
00:00:56,963 --> 00:00:59,912
More than anything, showing up matters.
